## Usage

### Sending Notifications via SDK / Core API

```typescript
import { SimpleNS } from '@simplens/core';

const simplens = new SimpleNS();

await simplens.send({
  channel: '{{channel}}',
  recipient: {
{{#each recipientFields}}
    {{this}}: 'your-{{this}}-value',
{{/each}}
{{#unless recipientFields.length}}
    // Add recipient fields
{{/unless}}
  },
  content: {
{{#each contentFields}}
    {{this}}: 'your-{{this}}-value',
{{/each}}
{{#unless contentFields.length}}
    // Add content fields
{{/unless}}
    attachments: [
      {
        id: 'att_123456789',
        filename: 'invoice.pdf',
        mime_type: 'application/pdf',
        size: 1048576,
        hash: 'e3b0c44298fc1c149afbf4c8996fb92427ae41e4649b934ca495991b7852b855',
        url: 'https://storage.example.com/attachments/invoice.pdf',
      },
    ],
  },
});
```

### Notification Schema

| Field | Type | Required | Description |
|:---|:---|:---|:---|
| `channel` | `'{{channel}}'` | Yes | Channel identifier |
{{#each recipientFields}}
| `recipient.{{this}}` | `string` | Yes | Target recipient {{this}} |
{{/each}}
{{#each contentFields}}
| `content.{{this}}` | `string` | Yes | Notification content {{this}} |
{{/each}}
| `content.attachments` | `FileAttachmentItem[]` | No | List of validated file attachments |

