## Development

### Prerequisites

- Node.js 18+
- npm or pnpm

### Setup & Commands

```bash
# Install dependencies
npm install

# Build TypeScript to dist/
npm run build

# Run unit tests
npm test

# Run tests in watch mode
npm run test:watch
```

